
---

### **2. `.gitignore` File**

Project root mein `.gitignore` naam se file banao aur yeh content daal do:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env/
venv/
ENV/

# Data & Models
*.csv
*.xlsx
models/*.pkl
data/*.csv

# Streamlit
.streamlit/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Logs
*.log